UID:8yXZzIwfy18VpPIcjTCVQs@commongroundmeditation.org
DTSTAMP:20260924T140812Z
DTSTART;TZID=America/Chicago:20270407T193000
DTEND;TZID=America/Chicago:20270407T210000
SUMMARY:📍💻 Weekly Practice Group with Stacy McClendon
LOCATION:Common Ground Meditation Center\, 2700 E 26th St\, Minneapolis\, M
 N 55406
DESCRIPTION:Format: In person + Online\nTeachers: Stacy McClendon\, Shelly 
 Graf\nProgram: Weekly Practice Groups\n\nThe weekly practice groups are de
 signed to be a cornerstone for one's practice by providing ongoing instruc
 tion and teachings that help illuminate the simple but challenging practic
 e of mindfulness. The Buddha taught that mindfulness is the way to go beyo
 nd habits of distraction and grasping. To walk this path of wisdom and com
 passion\, we need the support of a community that shares this intention. E
 ach session includes a guided meditation\, dharma talk\, and discussion. L
 ed by Shelly Graf and guest teachers.\n\nIf you'd like to donate to suppor
 t the teacher(s) and the center\, visit https://commongroundmeditation.or
 g/donate. Be sure to enter Stacy McClendon in the Teacher/Program box. 2/
 3 of the donation supports the teacher(s) and 1/3 supports the general ope
 rations of the center.Shelly is working through Sharon Salzberg’s book H
 eart as Wide as the World. Both experienced and beginning meditators are a
 lways welcome. No registration necessary.\n\nWe may be recording this Zoom
  meeting in order to be able to share the teacher’s video on Youtube. Pa
 rticipants’ video will not be included\, but the audio may be\, unless y
 ou ask us not to. Contact info@commongroundmeditation.org with any questio
 ns or concerns.\n\nZoom: https://us02web.zoom.us/j/83466749859?pwd=cEs5ZzZ
 HVXJYcVU0Z0lXZ2pWY2F1dz09\n\nDetails: https://www.commongroundmeditation.o
 rg/calendar/event/weekly-practice-group-with-shelly-graf-in-person-or-on-z
 oom-8yXZzIwfy18VpPIcjTCVQs
URL:https://www.commongroundmeditation.org/calendar/event/weekly-practice-g
 roup-with-shelly-graf-in-person-or-on-zoom-8yXZzIwfy18VpPIcjTCVQs
STATUS:CONFIRMED
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
END:VEVENT
